    {
      "id": "ZjSNCyeMUnFr5jIEDD1gs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1938.0936024735613,
      "y": 1076.0065424545312,
      "width": 830.699462890625,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 619598259,
      "version": 1217,
      "versionNonce": 1417057469,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783375868065,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FR1\n1. input : free form text, puts in conv table, admit to queue, ret id to user\n    a. apigw : RL , auth check\n2. worker picks from queu:\n    validation : \n        sensitive word filter, prompt inj check\n        query rewriting?\n    classify query:\n        simple : 1 tool + 1llm call\n    create plan using low cost model\n    per step of plan :\n        if tool required : pick tool using LLM + run\n        else\n            embed using embedding model\n            fetches chunks with query from vector db for required parts\n            cross encoder reranking(sev0) ????\n            invokes agent : agent/langgraph/rag pipeline\n4. long running agent : orchestrator/graph, agency pattern, maintains internal state,\n    inbuilt persistence (e..g langchain/langgraph) or custom : when done push to queue\n    - for each step output of agent : \n        sanitization\n        validate, if not satisfactory (<80% confidence) retry\n5. worker picks and notifies user OR user polls",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FR1\n1. input : free form text, puts in conv table, admit to queue, ret id to user\n    a. apigw : RL , auth check\n2. worker picks from queu:\n    validation : \n        sensitive word filter, prompt inj check\n        query rewriting?\n    classify query:\n        simple : 1 tool + 1llm call\n    create plan using low cost model\n    per step of plan :\n        if tool required : pick tool using LLM + run\n        else\n            embed using embedding model\n            fetches chunks with query from vector db for required parts\n            cross encoder reranking(sev0) ????\n            invokes agent : agent/langgraph/rag pipeline\n4. long running agent : orchestrator/graph, agency pattern, maintains internal state,\n    inbuilt persistence (e..g langchain/langgraph) or custom : when done push to queue\n    - for each step output of agent : \n        sanitization\n        validate, if not satisfactory (<80% confidence) retry\n5. worker picks and notifies user OR user polls",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
